eyes MD\" is a controlled medical device (generic name: program for general-purpose diagnostic imaging workstations, certification number: 302ADBZX00011000) under the \"Act on Quality, Efficacy and Safety Assurance of Pharmaceuticals, Medical Devices, etc.\" (Pharmaceuticals and Medical Devices Act)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "md_logo.png", "id": "5998065973633964", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003260_5998065976967297_260827317627691552_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4rTiF4BKyxsQ7kNvwHJKnEV&_nc_oc=AdmydiHLw5K_fZdexLWjMNhChUoPygeffVc-TMK-pZtUw_kfBQPaUn8CFHIT6FkBz5I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftsS8wI8HUwJp9_9KJUS4OSq7Tczs0Oj36H2-0gjBZVGw&oe=699EEA4D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_tate.png", "id": "2303415159832893", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974904_2303415163166226_7688600240374808365_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qm_anQxw8P0Q7kNvwFW7K6R&_nc_oc=AdmCNvCVro-eIfu5ahLs6W_2ts3ciYgjU0tjXqDYxBpSLMnjKY335-c_-BI4lz8SiYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftBjfsgJOc1Go3LPI2_XdQw6tSbqYzbZkJ6I80jzn8gGQ&oe=699EDCAC"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_miniyoko.png", "id": "950325029433473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031585_950325032766806_6345836855774372629_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R5PX7QLihSgQ7kNvwEX2ZEk&_nc_oc=AdnsHfP-HRJuD-3h6xR9FfXvgHfRGaIJjZ-8b-Ik8JbG0ziMFlZzuPzzIWN16C5Zr4k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afv6kfQVGi5VWltI9CEkeaP8rwcJoz3lmQy3GLfqABtwFg&oe=699EFE3D"}, {"file_name": "md_cover_yoko.png", "id": "773168277532939", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75223486_773168280866272_6988374572968566012_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=djZetjFxPScQ7